:: Carter Hero Award Part 6 [nobr]

/* Intro */
<<set $Minutes += 10>>
It doesn’t take you long to find <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span>. <span style="Color: LightCoral">He isn’t anywhere you can see, but as you look around and call out his name, you hear a quiet sobbing coming from his treehouse. You slowly climb up, peeking inside to see your friend huddled in the corner crying.</span> <br>

    <<set _ad to [
        {
            Name: "Player",
            State: {
                Mouth: "Frown",
            },
        },
        {
            Name: "Carter",
            State: {
